<i>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</i>

00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:08.730
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:08.730
<i>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</i>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.560
<i>昨日までのルール今日はただのルーズ</i>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.560
<b>Kinou made no ruuru kyou wa tada no ruuzu</b>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.560
<i>Yesterday’s rules are simply loose today</i>

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>こわして　タントツゴール</i>

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:24.250
<b>Kowashite dantotsu gooru</b>

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>The best goal is to break them</i>

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.650
<i>走りつづけてないと</i>

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.650
<b>hashiri tudukete nai to</b>

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.650
<i>If I don’t keep running</i>

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:29.980
<i>他に意味はないと</i>

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:29.980
<b>hokani imi wa nai to</b>

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:29.980
<i>There’s no other meaning</i>

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:33.980
<i>パンクな哲学なんだ</i>

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:33.980
<b>Panku na tetsukaku nanda</b>

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:33.980
<i>It’s a punk philosophy</i>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.370
<i>バイオリズムは　ツーバイリズムで</i>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.370
<b>Baiorizumu wa tsuubai rizumu de</b>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.370
<i>Biorhythm is a two-time rhythm</i>

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:43.540
<i>風景は　瞬間に　無数の線</i>

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:43.540
<b>Fuukei wa shunkan ni musuu no sen</b>

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:43.540
<i>The scenery instantly becomes countless lines</i>

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:46.460
<i>俺を取り巻く風</i>

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:46.460
<b>Ore wo torimaku kaze</b>

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:46.460
<i>The wind envelops me</i>

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>Inside Outside 攻めて</i>

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:51.130
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.510
<i>いっさいがっさい　抜いて</i>

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.510
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.510
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:55.720
<i>誰ひとりも　何ひとつも</i>

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:55.720
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:58.180
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:58.180
<i>前を　行かせたくはない</i>

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:58.180
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.560
<i>Inside Outside Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.560
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.560
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<i>いっさいがっさい Yes! SONIC!!</i>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<i>アブナイヨと Have A Nice は似てる</i>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>そう　どちらも紙一重なのさ</i>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<i>タイクツ脱ぎ捨てて　今すぐかけだせ</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:22.390
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:22.390
<i>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.640
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.640
<i>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</i>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.560
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.560
<i>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</i>

00:01:50.170 --> 00:01:51.630
All set.

00:01:51.630 --> 00:01:54.420
This is Knuckles. I'm finally done.

00:01:54.420 --> 00:01:56.670
We can leave at anytime!

00:01:56.670 --> 00:01:57.840
Roger!

00:02:06.390 --> 00:02:11.810
By passing through the Galaxy Corridor, there's another universe inside that gravity whirlpool.

00:02:12.440 --> 00:02:15.490
That's Metarex's universe.

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:18.820
There's something on your face.

00:02:18.820 --> 00:02:21.660
That's happening a lot recently.

00:02:30.830 --> 00:02:34.380
Are you scared that the gravity will squash us flat?

00:02:34.380 --> 00:02:35.840
I'm sure Tails has a solution.

00:02:36.380 --> 00:02:40.050
This ship can survive a black hole, so we'll be fine.

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:41.970
We'll make it through safely.

00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:48.060
But if we go to that universe, can we make it back?

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:50.650
Well...

00:02:50.650 --> 00:02:51.940
It'll all work out.

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:54.320
I guess so.

00:02:57.530 --> 00:03:01.660
If we don't do anything, the Metarex will destroy the galaxy.

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:04.240
That's right. We have to go!

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:08.330
What is it?

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:15.340
C'mon, what?

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:16.590
Well, Chris...

00:03:17.710 --> 00:03:21.220
This is Cosmo and our galaxy's problem.

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:24.470
So you don't have to come if you don't want to.

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:26.890
But you don't know for sure!

00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:30.980
My Earth might be in this universe! Am I wrong?

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:42.910
Okay, buddy.

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:46.490
Yeah.

00:03:47.290 --> 00:03:50.540
Besides, I'll be worried if I let you fend for yourselves.

00:03:50.540 --> 00:03:54.080
Since I'm 18 years old, I'll be your chaperone!

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:55.460
Really?

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:56.880
Really!

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:30.950
Anti-gravity shields on!

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:46.090
Entering Galaxy Corridor in...

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:53.270
10, 9, 8, 7, 6, 5, 4...

00:04:53.270 --> 00:04:57.440
3... 2... 1... 0!

00:04:57.440 --> 00:04:58.980
We're going in!

00:05:03.420 --> 00:05:08.430
Episode 66

00:05:03.420 --> 00:05:08.430
Crossing the Galaxy Corridor!

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:20.670
We're going to make it, right?

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:22.670
Yeah...

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:32.640
Whaaaaat?

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:36.060
Chrrrrriiisss?

00:06:15.060 --> 00:06:16.600
Is everybody all right?

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:21.520
Cheese...

00:06:23.940 --> 00:06:25.530
Where are we?

00:06:31.070 --> 00:06:32.950
What is this place?

00:06:32.950 --> 00:06:35.080
We're probably in...

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:36.540
The Galaxy Corridor.

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:37.830
This?

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:39.710
Let's keep going forward!

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:57.430
What are those root-like things?

00:06:57.430 --> 00:07:00.270
Probably space debris.

00:07:00.270 --> 00:07:03.110
Powerful gravitational forces compressed and warped its shape.

00:07:03.110 --> 00:07:04.690
They're creepy-looking.

00:07:09.820 --> 00:07:11.740
What's wrong?

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:17.250
It's the engines.

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:29.550
C'mon, everyone!

00:07:30.590 --> 00:07:34.180
I never thought I'd be cutting weeds in the middle of the galaxy.

00:07:34.180 --> 00:07:36.100
This is tough work!

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:39.980
What's that?

00:07:39.980 --> 00:07:41.980
A laser tree trimmer.

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:45.730
I never thought something I bought via mail order would come in handy!

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:47.480
Let me use it!

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:51.860
Get out of the way so that you're not in danger!

00:07:53.660 --> 00:07:55.160
Here I go!

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:04.630
Chris, those are your Power-Up Shoes.

00:08:04.630 --> 00:08:05.460
Yeah.

00:08:15.180 --> 00:08:16.850
Let's fall!

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:22.810
All done!

00:08:22.810 --> 00:08:25.440
Now we can keep going!

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:26.980
Actually...

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:30.650
It's getting narrower ahead, so it may be impossible.

00:08:31.190 --> 00:08:32.150
Oh no!

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:38.370
I have an idea!

00:08:39.490 --> 00:08:40.830
This is what we'll do!

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:55.010
Let's do it!

00:08:55.720 --> 00:08:58.220
That's impossible.

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:01.640
It is? In that case...

00:09:02.730 --> 00:09:04.690
Pushing won't work either.

00:09:04.850 --> 00:09:07.060
No, that!

00:09:20.490 --> 00:09:26.170
They must be trapped in the Galaxy Corridor right now.

00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:29.670
We can't waste this opportunity.

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:32.170
Let me carry out this task.

00:09:32.170 --> 00:09:34.380
No, I'm more suitable for this mission.

00:09:41.720 --> 00:09:46.480
I wonder why I like spicy curry?

00:09:48.350 --> 00:09:49.810
I know!

00:09:50.310 --> 00:09:52.980
Because it's not sweet!

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:55.280
Spicy!

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:09.130
How's my spicy curry power?

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:12.380
Enough, Yellow Zelkova!

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:14.010
You're going!

00:10:14.010 --> 00:10:18.180
Make sure you defeat that blue hedgehog!

00:10:18.180 --> 00:10:20.890
Thank you! I'm so happy!

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:33.690
What's going on? He's playing around!

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:37.900
I want to know why he's one of the four Metarex bosses.

00:10:43.530 --> 00:10:45.660
What's going on?

00:10:45.660 --> 00:10:47.620
It's our enemy's trap.

00:10:47.620 --> 00:10:50.960
They won't let us pass. Damn!

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:53.630
This is bad. We can't keep going forward.

00:10:56.420 --> 00:11:00.970
But this isn't the time to complain! We have to think of a solution!

00:11:09.520 --> 00:11:11.150
Ouch...

00:11:13.690 --> 00:11:17.190
That hurt! It didn't work.

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:24.410
What's going on?

00:11:24.410 --> 00:11:25.910
I don't know.

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:30.160
Someone's coming!

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:31.170
An enemy?

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:54.770
Who are you?

00:11:55.190 --> 00:11:59.400
I'm Yellow Zelkova, one of the four Metarex bosses!

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:22.970
Who are you?

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:27.430
I'm Yellow Zelkova, one of the four Metarex bosses!

00:12:27.430 --> 00:12:32.440
By orders of Dark Oak, I won't let you go any further!

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:34.440
What?

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:36.230
Take this!

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:41.400
Get back inside Blue Typhoon!

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:43.070
Okay!

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:46.780
You too, Amy!

00:12:47.780 --> 00:12:48.780
But...

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:51.660
Can't you understand that he's no ordinary enemy?

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:53.790
Okay.

00:12:55.330 --> 00:12:56.540
All right then...

00:13:01.460 --> 00:13:03.880
If he can lift that...

00:13:05.300 --> 00:13:07.220
It's heavy!

00:13:09.760 --> 00:13:11.020
Oh yeah?

00:13:14.560 --> 00:13:16.600
Unbelievable.

00:13:16.940 --> 00:13:18.190
Take this!

00:13:26.860 --> 00:13:28.240
Be careful!

00:13:28.240 --> 00:13:29.200
You too!

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:37.170
Shovel Claw!

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:43.300
What was that supposed to do?

00:13:44.130 --> 00:13:45.050
What?

00:13:47.840 --> 00:13:49.260
Knuckles!

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:57.190
Sonic!

00:14:02.190 --> 00:14:05.320
Run away, Sonic! He's too strong!

00:14:05.320 --> 00:14:08.070
I can see why he's one of the four Metarex bosses.

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:08.870
However...

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:14.830
He vanished?

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:20.380
You're powerful, but you're slow!

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:22.420
What did you say?

00:14:37.060 --> 00:14:40.900
If this keeps up, Blue Typhoon will be destroyed!

00:14:58.410 --> 00:15:02.080
I've just had enough of you!

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:05.380
Not bad. What's your name?

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:08.880
Knuckles the Echidna!

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:16.270
I'll engrave your name on your tombstone, along with "A red hedgehog sleeps here".

00:15:16.810 --> 00:15:20.600
I'm not a hedgehog!

00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:23.360
I'm an echidna!

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:25.570
Knuckles is incredible!

00:15:25.570 --> 00:15:26.610
Yeah!

00:15:31.320 --> 00:15:32.620
How's that?

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:43.540
How's this?

00:15:43.540 --> 00:15:45.880
No way...

00:15:45.880 --> 00:15:49.170
When it comes to power, no one can beat me!

00:15:56.640 --> 00:15:57.600
Knuckles!

00:15:57.600 --> 00:15:59.310
Knuckles!

00:16:00.180 --> 00:16:01.600
Sheesh...

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:06.150
How dare he do that...

00:16:06.520 --> 00:16:08.190
You're finished!

00:16:09.280 --> 00:16:10.320
Knuckles!

00:16:10.320 --> 00:16:11.610
Sonic!

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:25.960
I have a good idea.

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:29.710
Okay?

00:16:30.970 --> 00:16:31.720
Okay!

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:38.350
They're good at quickly running away.

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:42.230
How rude! We're not running away, but we are quick.

00:16:47.150 --> 00:16:48.690
Overhead!

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:53.950
How's that?

00:16:54.820 --> 00:16:56.700
There you are!

00:16:57.700 --> 00:16:58.910
Whoa!

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:07.710
See? You're running away.

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:09.460
Hey, over here!

00:17:10.380 --> 00:17:13.470
I'm a dancing fool!

00:17:13.470 --> 00:17:15.050
Don't make fun of me!

00:17:21.930 --> 00:17:23.600
Just a little more.

00:17:30.820 --> 00:17:32.740
Over here, bro!

00:17:32.940 --> 00:17:34.530
Hey, stupid!

00:17:34.530 --> 00:17:37.490
I'm gonna spank your butt!

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:39.330
How dare they insult me!

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:50.920
What are they doing?

00:17:50.920 --> 00:17:52.340
Aren't they going to fight?

00:17:54.840 --> 00:17:57.680
Be a man and stop running away! Fight me!

00:17:58.140 --> 00:17:59.470
We don't wanna!

00:18:05.390 --> 00:18:07.690
You're the idiots!

00:18:07.690 --> 00:18:09.730
How long are you planning to keep this up?

00:18:09.730 --> 00:18:11.190
I'll finish you with this!

00:18:14.990 --> 00:18:16.530
That's right!

00:18:17.990 --> 00:18:21.620
He still doesn't understand, so let's do it.

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:22.740
Yeah.

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:26.710
What are you talking about?

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:33.420
Tails!

00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:36.800
The Sonic Driver!

00:18:41.180 --> 00:18:42.930
See ya.

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:46.430
What is that? Tell me!

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:49.850
Connecting energy to the cannon's hammer!

00:19:02.070 --> 00:19:04.200
Just watch, Zelkova!

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:07.460
Pressurizing the cannon rod's ring energy!

00:19:07.460 --> 00:19:09.870
Sonic, start your spin!

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:11.080
Here I go!

00:19:14.960 --> 00:19:19.050
Trigger safety off! Targeting Metarex straight ahead!

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:28.850
Fire Sonic Driver!

00:19:39.990 --> 00:19:42.410
Is that a firework?

00:19:42.410 --> 00:19:43.950
Wow!

00:19:44.870 --> 00:19:48.040
I've never seen a firework up close!

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:50.040
Awesome!

00:19:58.170 --> 00:20:01.550
Hooray! Next is the engine!

00:20:01.550 --> 00:20:02.680
Knuckles!

00:20:02.680 --> 00:20:05.890
It's coming!

00:20:06.180 --> 00:20:08.890
It's here!

00:20:18.150 --> 00:20:20.900
I'm counting on you, Master Emerald!

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:29.950
What's happening?

00:20:41.170 --> 00:20:42.880
I'm pooped!

00:21:28.970 --> 00:21:31.350
Oh no! This is what you were planning all along!

00:21:31.350 --> 00:21:33.480
Next time we meet, I'll make you pay!

00:21:33.480 --> 00:21:34.520
Remember that!

00:21:35.560 --> 00:21:38.860
You just found out what we were doing, you muscled geezer?

00:21:38.860 --> 00:21:40.780
We'll eventually finish this once and for all!

00:21:44.030 --> 00:21:45.860
Sonic!

00:21:48.320 --> 00:21:49.620
Sonic!

00:22:07.720 --> 00:22:12.310
Wow! It's like riding on a roller coaster!

00:22:23.190 --> 00:22:24.570
There's the exit.

00:22:27.280 --> 00:22:31.450
I wonder what the Metarex's universe is like...

00:22:44.800 --> 00:22:54.180
<i>私たちの世界は　魔法をかけられて</i>

00:22:44.800 --> 00:22:54.180
<b>Watashitachi no sekai wa mahou o kakerarete</b>

00:22:44.800 --> 00:22:54.180
<i><i>There’s magic cast on our world.</i></i>

00:22:46.090 --> 00:22:49.090
<i>Original Concept Created by</i>

00:22:46.090 --> 00:22:49.090
<b>SEGA - SONIC TEAM</b>

00:22:49.680 --> 00:22:52.680
<i>Executive Producer</i>

00:22:49.680 --> 00:22:52.680
<b>Yuji Naka</b>

00:22:53.100 --> 00:22:56.100
<i>Producer</i>

00:22:53.100 --> 00:22:56.100
<b>Tadahito Matsumoto</b>

